      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEEPFLOAT DIVA (2) has proven frustrating for his loyal followers but clearly has his share of ability and strikes another suitable contest. Toeroek has his eye in and knows how to get the best out of him. Can break the drought. LIGHT THE NIGHT (3) made the perfect return at HQ when finishing over the top of them, knocking off subsequent Listed winner Bootlegger in the process. Could land in a sticky spot if Holder isn't sharp early, but he's classy enough to overcome it. VEXATIOUS DANCER (6) was strong fresh when running head-first into a red-hot Real Deluxe. She disappointed last time when clearly below her best but can bounce back sharply third up off a month freshen. SHADY THINKER (4) was too bad to be true when resuming in the G3 Behemoth Stakes. Also kept fresh with a month between runs and can improve sharply. MINTULEE (5) closed last campaign in career-best touch with a win over Sir Now in similar grade. Has jumped out well in readiness and can give this a big shake.",
